# Contributing

Thanks for taking a look at {var}project.name{/var}.

## Ground rules

- Keep generation deterministic (no timestamps, random values, or env-dependent output)
- Keep templates declarative (arb is not a scripting language)
- Prefer clear errors over “best effort” output

## Reporting issues

{if}links.issues
Use the issue tracker: {var}links.issues{/var}
{/if}

Include:
- arb version
- package version / commit
- minimal data.yaml + template reproducer
- expected vs actual output
